{"4606200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zangvadz", "steam_appid": 4606200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Zangvadz </strong>is <strong>Matter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/234717014a67c88063e296f4629cae07.poster.avif?t=1783362820\" aria-label=\"An ooli, a flying insectoid mammal with six legs and a pair of scythes for hands, is seen menacing a mouse cursor. The mouse cursor flees.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/234717014a67c88063e296f4629cae07.webm?t=1783362820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/234717014a67c88063e296f4629cae07.mp4?t=1783362820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a child of the <strong>Daughter</strong>. Many, in fact. Each living their separate lives in different times. The choices you'll make are up to you... Or them. Even perhaps, the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and follow the history of a rich, hand-made <strong>alien world</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear single-player adventure with multiple ways to complete each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge focus on <strong>dialogue and lore</strong>. Hard Sci-Fi / faux-fantasy setting grounded on rigorous astronomy, chemistry, and speculative biology<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-based action combat</strong>. Defeat enemies and hard bosses by being good at the game... Or don't, if you wish to be non-violent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different characters in different civilizational time periods with no equivalent to our own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement-focused gameplay</strong> with platforming sections and a strong sense of speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of secrets to find</strong>: Gear with fun bonuses and appearances, 12-page-long codex entries, and hidden time trial levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental and <i>weird</i> soundtrack: free improv, drone, cute little ballads, rapping in an alien tongue. Trust me on this one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of <strong>cool monsters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/ac9a02df9a26ec971d28de60c47b5c7d.poster.avif?t=1783362820\" aria-label=\"Tjok, the main character the introductory chapter of the game.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/ac9a02df9a26ec971d28de60c47b5c7d.webm?t=1783362820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/ac9a02df9a26ec971d28de60c47b5c7d.mp4?t=1783362820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider wishlisting, following me on social media  and sharing my work, it would help a ton! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With love,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606200/extras/b68cea035d016b3dc791f837c9e8a5c4.poster.avif?t=1783362820\" aria-label=\"A 